**A blank scroll**

This scroll comes with Storybound so you can see how documents work. Change it however you like:

- the text is in *config/storybound/texts/en_us/scroll.sbt*
- the title is in *config/storybound/lang/en_us.json*
- the kind and the rest is in *config/storybound/documents/scroll.json*

Save the file and run {color:#7a1f1f}/reload{/} in game.
